    <span class="tag tag-amber">Research Synthesis</span>
  </div>
  <h1>Evaluating Model Self-Improvement: Can AI Train Itself Better?</h1>
  <p class="lead">
    Self-improvement spans five levels — from rewriting prompts to recursively updating weights. Today's best AI agents clear the first two; everything above is still largely unsolved. Here's what the benchmarks show, where the gaps are, and what a rigorous evaluation framework would actually need to look like.
  </p>
  <div class="post-hero-meta">
