<article class="post-body">

<p class="src-legend">
  <strong>Evidence notation:</strong> Every substantive claim is tagged inline.
  <a class="src" href="#" onclick="return false">paper↗</a> links to the originating paper.
  <span class="inf">inferred</span> marks synthesis, interpretation, or proposals not directly stated in any paper.
  <span class="inf">illustrative</span> marks specific numbers used as examples that do not appear in any cited paper.
  The RE-Bench time-budget chart uses values interpolated from the paper's reported ratios (4× and 2×); RE-Bench does not publish a tabulated score curve, so the 4h and 8h data points are our reconstruction.
