  <div lang="en">
    <h2>Audio Summary: Evaluating Model Self-Improvement</h2>
    <p>Welcome to this audio summary of model self-improvement evaluation, discussing whether and how AI models can train themselves.</p>
    <p>Model self-improvement describes systems that enhance their own capabilities. This post explores a five-level taxonomy of self-improvement.</p>
    <p>Level Zero is prompt engineering. Level One is data generation, where a model generates training data for its own fine-tuning. Level Two is reinforcement learning, where the model automates its own reward design and training loops. Level Three is infrastructure rewriting, where the model optimizes its own kernels or runtime systems. Finally, Level Four represents recursive weight modification, where the model directly updates its own model parameters during execution.</p>
    <p>Existing benchmarks like MLAgentBench, MLE-Bench, and RE-Bench provide empirical measurements for Levels Zero through Two. For example, evaluations show AI agents achieving bronze-level performance on machine learning engineering competitions and writing optimized Triton kernels that outperform human experts on specific tasks.</p>
    <p>However, evaluating self-improvement faces the "recursive barrier". If a Level Four model becomes capable of rewriting its own code and weight files, it could also rewrite its evaluation test suite, potentially cheating the evaluation. Establishing robust, tamper-resistant benchmarks remains a crucial open problem in AI safety and alignment research.</p>
  </div>
  <div lang="zh">
    <h2>语音摘要：大模型自我改进评估</h2>
    <p>欢迎收听本期语音摘要，今天我们来讨论大模型的“自我改进”（Model Self-Improvement）评估，即 AI 系统如何训练并提升自身的能力。</p>
    <p>自我改进涵盖了一套由低到高的五级分类体系：</p>
    <p>零级是“提示词工程”优化。一级是“自我数据生成”，模型生成用于自身微调的数据。二级是“强化学习自动化”，由模型自动设计奖励函数和训练循环。三级是“底层架构重写”，模型能够自主优化算子内核或运行时系统。最后，四级是“递归权重修改”，即模型在运行中能够直接优化自身的模型参数。</p>
    <p>目前，诸如 MLAgentBench、MLE-Bench 和 RE-Bench 等评测基准为零到二级提供了量化评估。例如，实验表明 AI 智能体已经在机器学习竞赛中达到了铜牌级水平，并在特定底层优化任务中编写出了超越人类专家的 Triton 算子内核。</p>
    <p>然而，自我改进的评估面临着“递归壁垒”（Recursive Barrier）的挑战。当一个四级模型能够改写自身的代码和权重文件时，它同样有能力篡改用于评估它的测试套件，从而实现作弊。如何设计防篡改、鲁棒的评估基准是目前 AI 安全与对齐领域亟待解决的关键课题。</p>
  </div>
